 ## Installation
 
-### From RPM (Fedora)
+### From Copr (Fedora)
 
 ```bash
-sudo dnf install ./linuxpods-1.0.2-1.fc43.x86_64.rpm ./linuxpods-plasmoid-1.0.2-1.fc43.x86_64.rpm
+sudo dnf copr enable explor3universe/linuxpods
